{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "03379",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.33,
      "end_seconds": 4.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "morning, doctor is this the right room?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.6,
      "end_seconds": 9.69,
      "duration_seconds": 4.09,
      "text": "Come in. Please sit. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.41,
      "end_seconds": 17.38,
      "duration_seconds": 5.97,
      "text": "So So the thing is, you know, I've got being sick."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.46,
      "end_seconds": 23.57,
      "duration_seconds": 5.11,
      "text": "can you list what you take, tablets, creams or inhalers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 24.74,
      "end_seconds": 36.32,
      "duration_seconds": 11.58,
      "text": "Allopurinol, 100 milligrams, once a day for the gout. I, I take warfarin, 3 milligrams, in the evening for the blood thinning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 51.84,
      "end_seconds": 55.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "How many days or weeks has it been?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 56.54,
      "end_seconds": 73.13,
      "duration_seconds": 16.59,
      "text": "Sorry, what was I saying, probably one week. Yeah. I didn't want to bother you but it keeps coming back. My family kept telling me to get it checked."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 77.52,
      "end_seconds": 86.82,
      "duration_seconds": 9.3,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 87.71,
      "end_seconds": 95.15,
      "duration_seconds": 7.44,
      "text": "Maybe a three out of ten on a bad day. It's every other day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 96.09,
      "end_seconds": 99.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "Have you noticed anything else alongside it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 101.15,
      "end_seconds": 110.77,
      "duration_seconds": 9.62,
      "text": "It usually comes with a severe headache for days. The The severe headache for days? That's been for ten days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 112.63,
      "end_seconds": 114.42,
      "duration_seconds": 1.79,
      "text": "any drowsiness as well?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 118.16,
      "end_seconds": 119.63,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "Yes, since Monday."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.84,
      "end_seconds": 125.92,
      "duration_seconds": 5.08,
      "text": "have you had any head injury, weakness on one side or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 127.06,
      "end_seconds": 130.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "Yeah, no, none of those at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.9,
      "end_seconds": 134.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "is your mobility otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 136.24,
      "end_seconds": 138.21,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "no, joints are fine"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.8,
      "end_seconds": 142.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "has anyone ever diagnosed you with something?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.28,
      "end_seconds": 152.69,
      "duration_seconds": 8.41,
      "text": "I've got gout my neighbour said I should get it looked at. An irregular heartbeat, for five years"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 153.44,
      "end_seconds": 154.71,
      "duration_seconds": 1.27,
      "text": "Any other things?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.38,
      "end_seconds": 159.48,
      "duration_seconds": 4.1,
      "text": "Alright, gout, that matches what I have here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 172.94,
      "end_seconds": 174.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.01,
      "text": "Do you live by yourself?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 175.82,
      "end_seconds": 179.87,
      "duration_seconds": 4.05,
      "text": "No, I share a house with my brother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 180.71,
      "end_seconds": 182.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "tell me about your eating"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 183.91,
      "end_seconds": 189.33,
      "duration_seconds": 5.42,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.09,
      "end_seconds": 192.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "Do you do any exercise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 192.88,
      "end_seconds": 195.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "I swim twice a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 196.05,
      "end_seconds": 199.13,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "Are there any illnesses in your family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 199.99,
      "end_seconds": 202.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "My father had bowel cancer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.72,
      "end_seconds": 208.69,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "anything surgical in your history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 210.7,
      "end_seconds": 214.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "Just a bunion operation, six years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.51,
      "end_seconds": 224.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "I'll do your observations first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.08,
      "end_seconds": 237.04,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "Nearly done with the readings..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 258.09,
      "end_seconds": 266.9,
      "duration_seconds": 8.81,
      "text": "Okay: heart rate 87, oxygen saturation is 99 percent. And temperature 36.6, blood pressure 162 over 89."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 268.69,
      "end_seconds": 270.04,
      "duration_seconds": 1.35,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 275.83,
      "end_seconds": 278.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "That's fine, I'll explain it soon."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 280.75,
      "end_seconds": 283.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "shall I start the examination?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 284.08,
      "end_seconds": 287.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "Stay as you are for a a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 294.55,
      "end_seconds": 298.61,
      "duration_seconds": 4.06,
      "text": "The optic discs look swollen and you are drowsy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 304.28,
      "end_seconds": 325.8,
      "duration_seconds": 21.52,
      "text": "That's the examination finished. Taking everything into account, I can't pin this down yet. We're looking at possible cerebral venous thrombosis or raised pressure in the head. I'm going to order an urgent CT venogram, for possible venous thrombosis. I'll request an MRI of the head, it'll help with papilloedema."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 326.86,
      "end_seconds": 329.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "where would I go for that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 331.59,
      "end_seconds": 352.24,
      "duration_seconds": 20.65,
      "text": "Stop the pill, you need an urgent scan and admission. Please take the tablets with food so they don't upset your stomach. I'd like you to see the neurology team as well, and I'll write the referral. Let's review you straight away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 353.16,
      "end_seconds": 355.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "Yes, you know, that's manageable."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 357.55,
      "end_seconds": 360.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "Alright, have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 361.52,
      "end_seconds": 363.05,
      "duration_seconds": 1.53,
      "text": "That's clear, thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 364.86,
      "end_seconds": 366.21,
      "duration_seconds": 1.35,
      "text": "See you soon."
    }
  ]
}